window.RP_SESSION={"id":"S-35b73bd42c5a","messages":[{"id":"RP-0308488","time":"2026-09-27T03:49:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"델타인","profile":"델타인","identity":"unresolved","type":"dialogue","body":"!모닥불","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-0308489","time":"2026-09-27T03:49:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"모닥불에 불씨가 옮겨 붙습니다.\n따뜻한 온기가 피어오릅니다.\n\n ♩ https://youtu.be/3GNyTB6p6i0?si=4L6Rg34M-gtWRqUj","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-0308490","time":"2026-09-27T03:52:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"어유, 오랜만이구먼유... 지도 꼭두 새벽부터 나온게 신기허네유.\"\n\n피에르는 잠이 별로 오지 않았었던 탓에 새벽부터 훈련을 했고, 모닥불의 소리에 이끌려 모닥불로 향해 오고 있었다.\n\n그러고는 모닥불 불가 주변에 앉은 뒤, 하품을 하며, 손을 불가에 갖다대어 째기 시작했다.","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308491","time":"2026-09-27T03:53:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":":: 하품을 하며 눈을 부빗거리며 나오다 이 시간에도 모닥불을 피우고 있는 사람이 있는걸 보고 다가갑니다. 아직도 일어나 있는 사람이 있었네요.\n\n\"... ...안녕..하세요...?\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308492","time":"2026-09-27T03:54:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"어유, 반갑구먼유. 음.. 지랑 나으리가 서로 본 적이 있으셨었남?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308493","time":"2026-09-27T03:55:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"뭔가 익숙허네유... 언제 함 만나뵌적이 있는거 같어유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308494","time":"2026-09-27T03:56:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"음... ....아뇨, 아닌것같아요. 라이티티아라고 해요. 신입이랍니다.\"\n\n:: 피에르의 말에 고민을 하다가 고개를 도리도리 젓고 인사합니다.","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308495","time":"2026-09-27T03:57:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그려유? 어무튼 반갑구먼유. 지는 피에르라구 혀유. 농부라서 성은 읎어유. 근디 어쯔다가 꼭두 새벽부터 모닥불가에 오셨대유? 나으리가 피우신 건 어니신거 같은디 이 불도 누가 피운건지를 모르겄네유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308496","time":"2026-09-27T03:58:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그냥...자다가 일어났는데, 누가 모닥불에 아직도 남아있길래...와본건데...저도. 그러게요,  누가 피우신걸까요...?\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308497","time":"2026-09-27T03:58:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"검을 헛되게 쓰고 싶지 않았습니다. 단 한 순간도. 결국 몸을 혹사시키듯이, 의뢰에 돌아오고 나서도 훈련장에서 한참을 검을 휘둘렀습니다. 수건으로 땀을 닦으며 길드로 돌아가던 차에... 모닥불을 보고서 발길을 돌립니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308498","time":"2026-09-27T03:58:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……다들, 여기서 뭐하세요?\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308499","time":"2026-09-27T03:59:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"나으리도 오셨구먼유. 아, 지랑 같이 훈련을 허신 나으리가 나으리셨구먼유. 대충 모닥불이 피워져 있길래 함 와 봤어유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308500","time":"2026-09-27T04:00:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"근디 새벽부터 훈련을 할라 케니까 죽을 것 같네유... 어띃게 그릏게 버티셨담?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308501","time":"2026-09-27T04:01:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 후후...하다보면 익숙해지는거 아닐까요..? 아, 엘레나님. 좋은 밤이네요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308502","time":"2026-09-27T04:01:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아… 티티아 씨도 계셨네요. 저도 죽을 맛이네요…. 아하하….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308503","time":"2026-09-27T04:01:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"좋은 밤이에요, 다들.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308504","time":"2026-09-27T04:01:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"푸흥.. 에취! 어유... 좋은 밤이구먼유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308505","time":"2026-09-27T04:02:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"잠깐은 이렇게 한가로이 있는것도 좋으니까요. 기분이 나쁘지않네요..\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308506","time":"2026-09-27T04:02:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"티티아의 눈치를 살핍니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308507","time":"2026-09-27T04:02:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그릏지유. 원래는 션 나으리나 마리아 나으리께서 밤에 모닥불을 급나게 피우셨었는데 말이여유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308508","time":"2026-09-27T04:02:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...이 모닥불도 션 나으리나 마리아 나으리가 피우셨었을라남...?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308509","time":"2026-09-27T04:02:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……션 공대장님께선, 당분간 좀 바쁘실 거예요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308510","time":"2026-09-27T04:03:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"당분간은, 토르번 공대장님께 가보셔요….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308511","time":"2026-09-27T04:04:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...아무래도요...그나저나, 엘레나님. 뭔가 일이라도..? 왜 제 눈치를...\"\n\n:: 의아하다는 듯 고개를 갸웃거립니다.","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308512","time":"2026-09-27T04:04:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……네?\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308513","time":"2026-09-27T04:04:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"엘레나도 의아해하며 티티아를 봅니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308514","time":"2026-09-27T04:04:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그려유? 무슨 일로 바쁘시대유?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308515","time":"2026-09-27T04:05:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...? 아니면 괜찮지만...뭔가, 보는게 느껴져서...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308516","time":"2026-09-27T04:05:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"……왜 이러는 거지? 억지로 괜찮은 척이 아니라, 정말 모르는 눈치 같아.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308517","time":"2026-09-27T04:05:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":":: 고개를 갸웃거리다가 끄덕입니다. 뭐 별거아니겠죠. 착각했나봐요","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308518","time":"2026-09-27T04:05:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……아, 아. 션 공대장님… 개인사세요. 저희도 자, 잘… 몰라요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308519","time":"2026-09-27T04:05:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"?\"\n\n피에르는 엘레나의 행동에 의아함을 느끼며, 머리를 긁적였다.","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308520","time":"2026-09-27T04:06:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그려유? 어쩔 수 읎지유. 션 나으리도 바쁘시기는 허실테니까유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308521","time":"2026-09-27T04:07:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그나저나, 피에르 선배님도 엄청 오랜만이네요. 그동안 어떻게 지내셨어요?\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308522","time":"2026-09-27T04:08:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"음... 오늘처럼 훈련장에서 훈련을 하거나, 밭에서 작물을 심거나, 약초를 캤었던거 같어유. 아! 그리고 교회도 좀 갔었어유. 지가 그.. 물론 베어 나으리랑 같이 허기는 혔었는디 신성력으로 베어 나으리를 치료 해 봤어서 말이여유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308523","time":"2026-09-27T04:09:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"신앙이라는게 정말루 신기한 거 같어유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308524","time":"2026-09-27T04:09:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아, 베어 씨… 좋으신 분이죠. 아, 맞다… 브로치, 그거 갚아드려야 하는데…….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308525","time":"2026-09-27T04:09:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그래요? 저는… 정령이 제일 신기하던데.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308526","time":"2026-09-27T04:09:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"신앙이 더 대단하지 않을까...싶긴 한데...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308527","time":"2026-09-27T04:10:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아, 그것도 신기허긴 허지유. 근데 지는 눈 앞에 보이는거에 더 관심이 있다구 혀야허남? 무튼 그려서 말이여유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308528","time":"2026-09-27T04:10:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"루체 나으리랑 마리아 나으리랑 같이 의뢰를 뛰어 다니다 보니 그릏게 된거 같어유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308529","time":"2026-09-27T04:10:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"이것저것 다 하더라고요. 티티아 씨가 정령들과 사이가 좋으셔서 그런가? 엄청 유능… 하달까요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308530","time":"2026-09-27T04:10:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"…아하하, 저도 티티아 씨랑 의뢰에 자주 나가서 그런가 봐요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308531","time":"2026-09-27T04:10:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"라이티티아 나으리도 정령사이신갑네유. 폴라리스 나으리처럼 엘프이기도 허신감?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308532","time":"2026-09-27T04:11:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"솔직히 조금 부럽기까지 하던데…. 저는 부수는 것만 할 줄 아니까요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308533","time":"2026-09-27T04:11:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그려유? 엘레나 나으리도 클로에 나으리처럼 의뢰는 별로 안 뛰셨을줄 알었는디. 의외시네유. 아, 그려서 훈련장에 있으셨었던 거였지유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308534","time":"2026-09-27T04:11:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":":: 도리도리 고개를 젓습니다. \n\n\"뭐라도 특별한게 있어서 그랬다면 좋겠다-. 싶지만서도. 전 그냥 평범한 사람이라서요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308535","time":"2026-09-27T04:11:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아유, 부수는걸로 뭔가를 지켰으믄 된거지유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308536","time":"2026-09-27T04:12:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"내심 큰 충격을 받습니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308537","time":"2026-09-27T04:12:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"나… 의뢰, 안 다닐 모험가로 보이는 거야…?","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308538","time":"2026-09-27T04:12:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"우음... 평범한 시람이라기에는... 어디 극단에서 나오시는 분들이랑 비슷한 외모셔서 엘프신줄 알었구먼유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308539","time":"2026-09-27T04:12:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그렇죠. 저는 그런게 더 부러운걸요. 정령이 없으면 전 아무것도 아니니까.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308540","time":"2026-09-27T04:12:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"나, 나 엄청 열심히 다녔는데…….","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308541","time":"2026-09-27T04:12:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"벌써 4골드나 모았는데…….","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308542","time":"2026-09-27T04:12:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...? 칭찬 감사해요. 스승님이 들으면 좋아하시겠어요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308543","time":"2026-09-27T04:13:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"스승님도 있으셔유? 정령사도 스승이나 제자가 있는 직업인가 보구먼유. 신기허네유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308544","time":"2026-09-27T04:13:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……정령이 없으면 아무것도 아니라뇨? 티티아 씨는 그러니까… 지휘관 같은 거죠.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308545","time":"2026-09-27T04:14:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"응? 아뇨, 제 스승님은 저를 키워주셨어요. 같은 정령술사는 아니셨죠. 지금 나이에 아버지라고 불리긴 싫으니까 스승이라고 부르라고 하셔서...'","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308546","time":"2026-09-27T04:14:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그릏게 따지믄 지랑 엘레나 나으리는 검이 읎으면 그냥 농부인디유 뭘.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308547","time":"2026-09-27T04:14:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"도끼도 쓰기 나름이에요. 장작을 팰지, 괴물을 죽일지… 쓰는 사람에 따라서……\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308548","time":"2026-09-27T04:14:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"…….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308549","time":"2026-09-27T04:14:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"마, 맞긴 하지만요…….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308550","time":"2026-09-27T04:14:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아, 그려유?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308551","time":"2026-09-27T04:14:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...지휘관은 아직 되지 못하죠, 전 아이들의 배려에 몸을 내려놓은 상태니까...조금 더 잘 다룰수 있어야겠지만...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308552","time":"2026-09-27T04:15:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":":: 꾸닥. \n\n\"네에. 그러고보면 스승님도 참 특이하셨네요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308553","time":"2026-09-27T04:15:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"어째 속상합니다... 그냥… 농부…?","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308554","time":"2026-09-27T04:15:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"우음... 지는 자연에 대해서는 잘 몰러서 말이여유. 지 스승님도 신기허신 분이시기는 혔는디 말이여유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308555","time":"2026-09-27T04:16:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"끄응, 엘레나는 수건으로 앞머리를 탈탈 텁니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308556","time":"2026-09-27T04:16:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……그, 그냥 농부… 의뢰는, 안 나가는 줄…….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308557","time":"2026-09-27T04:16:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"중얼중얼...","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308558","time":"2026-09-27T04:17:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"?\"\n\n피에르는 엘레나의 말을 이해하지 못한 것 같아 보였다.","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308559","time":"2026-09-27T04:17:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"피에르는 머리를 또 다시 긁적였다...","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308560","time":"2026-09-27T04:17:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아하하, 엘레나님도 어엿한 길드원이시니까요...저보다 더 뛰어나시니까 그냥 농부라고 생각하지 않으셔도 괜찮죠. 그냥 비유일 뿐이에요. 엘레나님.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308561","time":"2026-09-27T04:18:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"티티아의 말에 옅게 웃어봅니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308562","time":"2026-09-27T04:18:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"라이티티아의 말에 엘레나의 말을 이해 한 피에르는...\n\n\"농부가 나쁜거여유?!\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308563","time":"2026-09-27T04:18:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"저도 아직 신입……\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308564","time":"2026-09-27T04:19:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":":: 그 외침에 꺄르르륵 웃습니다.","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308565","time":"2026-09-27T04:19:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아, 아니…! 저, 저도 목장주 딸이지만요! 그치만, 그치만 여긴 길드잖아요!\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308566","time":"2026-09-27T04:19:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그냥 농부가 될 생각이었으면, 고향도 안 떠났다고요…!\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308567","time":"2026-09-27T04:19:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"목장주유? 오오... 지 마을에서는 목장 일을 허시는 시람들은 죄다 떵떵 거리면서 살으셨었는디...\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308568","time":"2026-09-27T04:19:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"모르쇠...","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308569","time":"2026-09-27T04:19:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"지랑은 다르시네유. 지는 그냥 집을 이어서 농부나 될려고 혔었는디 말이여유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308570","time":"2026-09-27T04:20:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"근디 부모님 장례식을 허구, 정신을 차리니께 지 땅은 웬 누구헌티 팔려가 있구, 당장 가진건 스승이라는 시람이 주신 검밖에 읎어서 모험가 일을 허게 됐네유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308571","time":"2026-09-27T04:21:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……보통은, 하고 싶은 게 있어서 다들 여기 오셨을 거 아녜요…? 티티아 씨도, 하고 싶은 게 있어서 오셨을 테고….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308572","time":"2026-09-27T04:21:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"근디 지가 글을 읽을줄도, 쓸 줄도 모르니께 급나게 속거나 사기를 당허구 살았었지유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308573","time":"2026-09-27T04:21:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"지는 아카쿠 나으리헌티 추천을 받어서 왔어유. 돈 때문에 왔었는디 정작 여기서 밭 일을 혀 가믄서 돈을 벌거나, 여러 의뢰들을 허믄서 돈을 벌게 되서 말이여유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308574","time":"2026-09-27T04:21:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"살기위해 올수도 있으니까요. 고생하셨네요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308575","time":"2026-09-27T04:22:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그르다가 클로에 나으리헌티 첫눈에 반허구, 고백도 혀구, 사귀기도 혀게 됐는디... 음... 클로에 나으리랑 결혼을 헐 때믄 길드를 나갈것 같기도 혀유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308576","time":"2026-09-27T04:22:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"고맙구먼유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308577","time":"2026-09-27T04:22:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"하긴, 숙식 해결이 되니까… 다들 살기 위해서 오셨으려나…?","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308578","time":"2026-09-27T04:22:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그르믄 엘레나 나으리랑 라이티티아 나으리는 뭘 허실려구 길드로 들어오셨대유?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308579","time":"2026-09-27T04:23:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"…더 많은 사람을 돕고 싶었어요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308580","time":"2026-09-27T04:23:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"스승님 찾으려고요. 혼자 기약없이 돌아다니는것보다는 어디라도 들어가서 찾는게 더 나을테니까.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308581","time":"2026-09-27T04:23:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"지 어렸을때랑 판박이네유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308582","time":"2026-09-27T04:23:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"티티아의 얘기를 처음 듣는지, 두 눈을 꿈뻑입니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308583","time":"2026-09-27T04:24:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"오... 지는 스승님이랑은... 좀 그려서 말이여유. 그려도 고맙기는 현디... 어무튼, 좋은 목표이시구먼유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308584","time":"2026-09-27T04:24:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……스승님을 꼭, 찾으면 좋겠네요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308585","time":"2026-09-27T04:25:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...살아 계시는지부터 알아야하지만요. 언젠가는...뭐라도 찾을 수 있으면 좋겠는데요...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308586","time":"2026-09-27T04:25:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"정령들은 들은 거 없대요? 스승님이면, 정령술사 아녜요?\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308587","time":"2026-09-27T04:26:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"세상이 넓기는 현디. 그려도 언젠가는 찾을 수 있을거라구 생각혀유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308588","time":"2026-09-27T04:26:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"? 사실상 아버지 되시는 분이라 혀셔서 정령 술사는 어니시라 허시지 않으셨어유?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308589","time":"2026-09-27T04:26:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"하잠만못읽엇어요","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308590","time":"2026-09-27T04:26:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"하그러네","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308591","time":"2026-09-27T04:27:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"머쓱.......","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308592","time":"2026-09-27T04:27:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"이모티콘","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308593","time":"2026-09-27T04:27:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"이모티콘","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308594","time":"2026-09-27T04:27:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"두 눈 질끈. 괜히 도와주려다 실패한 홍당무.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308595","time":"2026-09-27T04:27:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"으음...이게 좀 복잡해서...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308596","time":"2026-09-27T04:27:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"좀... 쪽팔린지 수건으로 얼굴 벅벅.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308597","time":"2026-09-27T04:28:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"저는 부모님을 기억하지 못해요. 아무것도 없이 떠돌던 저를 스승님이 주워서 키우셨거든요. 그러면서 배운건...말하는 법이라던가, 지식이나, 그런거였어서...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308598","time":"2026-09-27T04:29:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"정령들은 스승님에게 관심조차...없었구요. 가끔씩 저를 보고 가는게 전부였어요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308599","time":"2026-09-27T04:29:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"어유, 그 정도믄 아버지가 맞네유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308600","time":"2026-09-27T04:29:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……아아.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308601","time":"2026-09-27T04:30:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"관심조차 없었으면… 모르겠네요….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308602","time":"2026-09-27T04:31:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"네에...제대로 기억도 못할지도요...~\"\n:: 그러고보니, 스승님이 어떤 사람이었더라. 목소리나, 냄새, 얼굴. \n무엇하나 제대로 기억나는게 없네요. ...언젠가 만난다면 기억해낼 수 있을까요..","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308603","time":"2026-09-27T04:32:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"티티아의 등을 토닥입니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308604","time":"2026-09-27T04:32:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"꼭 찾아요, 티티아 씨.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308605","time":"2026-09-27T04:32:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"음... 기적이 있으믄 가능허지 않을까유? 지는 헐 수 있는게 별로 읎으니께... 교회에서 들은대로 신 나으리헌티 기도나 혀 드릴게유.\"\n\n피에르는 라이티티아에게 기도를 해 줬다...","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308606","time":"2026-09-27T04:32:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!의지","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308607","time":"2026-09-27T04:32:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'피에르'의 의지 판정 :\n[9] + [3] = [12]\n결과 : 완벽한 성공, 운명은 당신의 편입니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-0308608","time":"2026-09-27T04:32:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"의지가 가득찬다...","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308609","time":"2026-09-27T04:33:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아, 아… 저도 기도해야겠어요. 기도는 간절할 때만 했었는데….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308610","time":"2026-09-27T04:33:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!의지","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308611","time":"2026-09-27T04:33:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...아하하, 감사해요. 괜찮아요. 언젠가는 찾을 수 있을 거라고 생각하니까.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308612","time":"2026-09-27T04:33:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'Reggiano Elena'의 의지 판정 :\n[6] + [3] = [9]\n결과 : 훌륭한 성공, 운명이 당신을 이끕니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-0308613","time":"2026-09-27T04:34:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"두 손을 모으고, 눈을 감아 간절하게 빕니다...","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308614","time":"2026-09-27T04:34:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"오... 지가 사제 나으리는 어니라서 잘 모르겄는디 뭔가 빛이 났었던거 같어유. 어닌감?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308615","time":"2026-09-27T04:34:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":":: 분명, 어떤 모습으로라도 만날 수 있겠죠. 많은 부분이 바뀌어도 그토록 소중한 사람이라면 알 수 있을거에요. 그래야하니까.","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308616","time":"2026-09-27T04:34:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...후후. 다정하신 분들이네요, 두분 다.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308617","time":"2026-09-27T04:35:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아유, 뭘유. 같은 한 식구인디 말이여유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308618","time":"2026-09-27T04:35:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"스승님도 저를 찾으러 오시려고 할테니 괜찮을거라고 생각하지만요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308619","time":"2026-09-27T04:35:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그럼 언젠가 만나겠네요. 이렇게 멋져진 티티아 씨를 보면서 감탄하실걸요?\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308620","time":"2026-09-27T04:36:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그릏지유. 지가 어는 그... 뻬르난떼라는 길드안에 계신 이상허신 나으리도 그.. 맥도귈인지 맥도궐인지 허는 종자 나으리를 찾으시려구 허시니께유. 그려도 뭔가 진전이 있다구 지를 잡아놓고 1시간을 떠들어 대셨었는디. 나으리도 잘 되실거여유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308621","time":"2026-09-27T04:37:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"후후..! 엄청 화내실지도 몰라요, '겨우겨우 제대로 된 몸가짐을 익히게 해놨더니 이러고 있어?!' 라면서...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308622","time":"2026-09-27T04:37:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"으음, 저희 부모님도 분명……\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308623","time":"2026-09-27T04:38:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"…….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308624","time":"2026-09-27T04:38:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"음... 무슨 느낌인지 알 것 같네유. 클로에 나으리도 지가 의뢰에서 헌 일들을 말허믄 경악을 허시던디 말이여유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308625","time":"2026-09-27T04:38:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"실망, 하시겠지…. 내가 이렇게나 못된 사람이 됐으니까….","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308626","time":"2026-09-27T04:38:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"? 나으리네도 부모님이 돌아가셨어유?\"\n\n피에르는 아무런 악의가 없이 순수 한 느낌으로 말했다...","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308627","time":"2026-09-27T04:38:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"의뢰에선, 어쩔 수 없지만 말이에요….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308628","time":"2026-09-27T04:39:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아, 아뇨! 조부모님들까지 다 살아계세요!\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308629","time":"2026-09-27T04:39:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아하하.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308630","time":"2026-09-27T04:39:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"어유, 쌩쌩허시네유. 지 부모님들이랑 할어부지 할무니도 다 병으로 가셨었는디...\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308631","time":"2026-09-27T04:40:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"이러면 내가 할 말이 없잖아……!!!","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308632","time":"2026-09-27T04:40:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"어째서인지, 분하지만 아무 말도 못하고 입술만 우물쭈물...","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308633","time":"2026-09-27T04:41:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"병이라는게 무서운 것 같구먼유. 그리구 음... 살아계실때 크게 막 도움이 안 뎌서 아쉽기도 혀구유. 그려도 약혼을 혀게 되기도 혔구, 세상을 돌아다녀 뵀으니께 지 부모님이 하늘에서 좋아 허실거라 생각혀는구먼유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308634","time":"2026-09-27T04:42:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"그냥, 마냥 화목하고... 모두가 함께하던 가정에서 살아온 엘레나는 아무 말도 할 수 없었습니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308635","time":"2026-09-27T04:42:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"…….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308636","time":"2026-09-27T04:42:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"? 왜 그러셔유? 다들 갑자기 조용 혀 지셨댜? 무슨 일들 있으셔유?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308637","time":"2026-09-27T04:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"마른세수 벅벅...","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308638","time":"2026-09-27T04:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……죄송해요, 어떻게 반응할지 감이 안 와서요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308639","time":"2026-09-27T04:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"으음. 그래도, 다시금. 되돌아올거라고 생각해요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308640","time":"2026-09-27T04:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"어유, 그려도 다들 오래 살만큼 살고 가셨으니께 괜찮지유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308641","time":"2026-09-27T04:44:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"스승님이 가르쳐준 신학에서도, 정령들이 알려준 세상에 대해서도 배워왔지만...모두들, 항상 그랬어요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308642","time":"2026-09-27T04:44:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그저 부모님들헌티 손주를 못 보여드린게 아쉽구먼유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308643","time":"2026-09-27T04:44:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"다들 어떤 모습으로든 되돌아와서 함께 하고 있을거라고. 그러니까 괜찮다고. 혹시 모르죠, 피에르님의 근처에서 이미 같이 계실지.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308644","time":"2026-09-27T04:45:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그릏게 많이 배우시구, 기억을 혀시는대두 나으리의 스승님 얼굴을 기억을 못허시는게 신기허네유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308645","time":"2026-09-27T04:45:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"... ...그러게요?\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308646","time":"2026-09-27T04:45:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...어라...왜, 기억을...못하지...?\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308647","time":"2026-09-27T04:45:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……너무 오래 돼서 그런 거 아녜요…?\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308648","time":"2026-09-27T04:45:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아유, 당연허지유. 그릏지 않더라두 열심히 살어야지유...\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308649","time":"2026-09-27T04:46:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그르게유. 보통은 너무 어렸을때믄 배운것도 다 기억이 안 나질 않어유?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308650","time":"2026-09-27T04:46:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아니믄 막 션 나으리나 타냐 나으리처럼 얼굴을 가리셨다든감.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308651","time":"2026-09-27T04:47:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"... ... ...\"\n\n:: 제 머리를 잡고서 생각에 빠집니다. 대체, 왜 기억을 못하는걸까요? 잊었다? 어째서...? 어떤 모습이었는지조차 제대로 기억나지 않지만...그래도, 얼굴을 봤던 것, 같은...데.\n\n피에르의 말에 고개를 조금 젓습니다. \n\n\"...아니었,던것 같은데. ...죄송해요, 지금은. 머리가...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308652","time":"2026-09-27T04:47:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……의뢰 다녀온 뒤에, 제대로 못 쉬었죠? 그래서 더 그럴 거예요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308653","time":"2026-09-27T04:48:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"우음... 어쩔 수 읎지유. 시상에는 신기 허거나, 말로 다 뭘 혈 수 읎는 것들이 많으니께유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308654","time":"2026-09-27T04:48:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"좀 쉬고 나서, 다시 생각해 봐요. 응?\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308655","time":"2026-09-27T04:49:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"피에르는 정체 모를 타냐의 위화감에 주위를 둘러봤으나, 역시 아무것도 발견하지 못했다.\n\n피에르는 머리를 긁적이며, 다시 모닥불에 손을 쬣다.","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308656","time":"2026-09-27T04:49:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"... ...네에...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308657","time":"2026-09-27T04:50:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"우음....\"\n\n피에르는 이때 잭 해리슨이나 션이나 그외의 기타 인물들한테 배웠었던 말 재간을 이용하기로 마음을 먹었다.\n\n\"아, 분위기를 환기시켜야 겄구먼유. 나으리들은 목표를 이뤄서 은퇴를 허시게 되믄 무슨 일을 허실거 같어유?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308658","time":"2026-09-27T04:51:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"... ...은퇴...라...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308659","time":"2026-09-27T04:52:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...스승님이랑 같이 조금 더 여행을 하면 좋겠네요. 아마 같이 다른 곳도 많이 보고, 그러지 않을까요?\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308660","time":"2026-09-27T04:52:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……어, 음. 저는 델타인이랑 같이 결혼해서 아이 낳지 않을까요…?\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308661","time":"2026-09-27T04:53:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"오, 결국은 델타인 나으리랑 사귀시는 갑네유?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308662","time":"2026-09-27T04:53:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……네….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308663","time":"2026-09-27T04:53:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"얼굴이 조금 붉어집니다...","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308664","time":"2026-09-27T04:53:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"겨, 결혼 전제로… 마, 만나고 있어요….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308665","time":"2026-09-27T04:54:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"오오... 그릏게 짧은 사이에 만나서 사귀고 결혼까지 준비를 허시다니... 신기허네유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308666","time":"2026-09-27T04:54:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"와...아이라... ...좋죠, 새로운 생명은. 언제나 사랑스러우니까요. 저도 그런 사람을 만날 수 있으면 좋을텐데.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308667","time":"2026-09-27T04:54:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아유, 나으리도 가능허겄지유. 딱 만나자 마자 느낌이 오시는 시람이 있어유. 그 시람을 낚아 채믄 되는구먼유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308668","time":"2026-09-27T04:55:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아, 아뇨! 준비는 아니고…! 그냥, 생각만… 우선, 아무튼! 티티아 씨는 완전 참한 아가씨잖아요. 분명 멋진 사람 만나요! 꼭!\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308669","time":"2026-09-27T04:55:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아하하, 네에. 그럴만한 사람이 있을지, 만날 수야 있을지...싶지만요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308670","time":"2026-09-27T04:55:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"뭐, 못만나도...언젠가, 스승님이랑 둘이서 계속 살아도 되니까요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308671","time":"2026-09-27T04:56:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아유, 있을거여유. 음... 세상은 넓구, 시람은 많으니께유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308672","time":"2026-09-27T04:56:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"네에, 그러길 바래야죠.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308673","time":"2026-09-27T04:57:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"저도, 이런 말 하기 좀 그렇지만…….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308674","time":"2026-09-27T04:57:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"저는, 여자면 그래도 뭐… 가정 이루고, 이러고 사는 게 제일 좋다고 생각했거든요?\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308675","time":"2026-09-27T04:58:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"근데… 모험해보니까, 꼭 그렇지는 않은 것만 같아요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308676","time":"2026-09-27T04:58:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그거는 맞는거 같어유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308677","time":"2026-09-27T04:58:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……저는, 그냥 티티아 씨가 행복해지면 좋겠어요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308678","time":"2026-09-27T04:58:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"라구 허기에는 지 마을의 아낙네들은 죄다 근육질에 뭔 사냥도 허구 다녔으니께...\"\n\n피에르는 고향 생각에 몸서리를 쳤다...","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308679","time":"2026-09-27T05:00:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"엘레나도 고향 생각에 몸 부르르...","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308680","time":"2026-09-27T05:00:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……어우.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308681","time":"2026-09-27T05:00:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...그랬던가요...? 저는, 그거까지는 배우지 않았던 것 같아요. 결혼...이라는 것도 사실, 어떤건지...? 정도만 배워서...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308682","time":"2026-09-27T05:01:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"사귄다...라는 것도 엘레나님을 보고, 알게 된 거였죠. 뭐랄까, 남녀간의 사랑이라는건...어려운 것 같아요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308683","time":"2026-09-27T05:01:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"음... 애를 낳는 거지유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308684","time":"2026-09-27T05:01:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"티티아를 보며 당황하다, 피에르의 말에 더욱 당황합니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308685","time":"2026-09-27T05:02:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그려도 사귀게 되믄 막 시상이 더 밝어지구... 분홍색 느낌의 빛이 들어오는 느낌인거 같어유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308686","time":"2026-09-27T05:02:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"가슴이 시큰 혀 지기도 허구 말이여유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308687","time":"2026-09-27T05:02:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아, 아뇨! 아뇨! 그렇게 단순하게 표현되는 게 아니잖아요, 결혼은!\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308688","time":"2026-09-27T05:02:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...그건 아픈거 아닌가요?\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308689","time":"2026-09-27T05:02:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그런게 '사귄다'라는거면 너무 아파서 하고싶지 않을 것 같은걸요...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308690","time":"2026-09-27T05:02:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"?\"\n\n피에르는 머리를 긁적였다.","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308691","time":"2026-09-27T05:03:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……근데, 사랑하면 좀 저렇긴 해요…. 티티아 씨. 저는 저정도는 아니지만….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308692","time":"2026-09-27T05:03:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"어무튼, 함 하시게 되믄 생각이 달러지실거여유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308693","time":"2026-09-27T05:03:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"감정이라는 걸로, 시야에 새로운 색채가 들어오는건 무언가 말이 안되는...으음...그런가요...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308694","time":"2026-09-27T05:03:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"지는 8달동안 짝시랑을 혀서 그른감...\"\n\n심지어 피에르의 첫사랑이었으니...","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308695","time":"2026-09-27T05:03:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...하긴, 저보다 잘 아시겠지요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308696","time":"2026-09-27T05:03:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그려유?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308697","time":"2026-09-27T05:04:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"음... 그르믄 결혼이 뭐여유?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308698","time":"2026-09-27T05:04:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그냥… 조금 더 긍정적으로 변하고… 기분이 좋아요. 괜히 기대고 싶고, 장난도 치고 싶고… 전 그러고 있어요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308699","time":"2026-09-27T05:04:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……미래를, 함께 보내는 것…?\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308700","time":"2026-09-27T05:04:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아이는, 못 가질 수도 있잖아요….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308701","time":"2026-09-27T05:04:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"남자라고 너무, 막 말하시죠?! 아이에 대해서!\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308702","time":"2026-09-27T05:04:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"갑자기 버럭!","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308703","time":"2026-09-27T05:05:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"델타인도, 아이를 11명을 낳자고 했다고요!\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308704","time":"2026-09-27T05:05:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"? 그를 수 있어유?\"\n\n피에르는 진짜 모르고 있는 것 같았다...","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308705","time":"2026-09-27T05:05:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"엘레나는 할 말을 잃었습니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308706","time":"2026-09-27T05:05:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"…….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308707","time":"2026-09-27T05:06:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아, 안… 아…….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308708","time":"2026-09-27T05:06:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"사귀는 거랑 결혼이랑 비슷 비슷 헌거 아니였어유? 막 같이 살구, 애를 낳는거 빼믄 거기서 거기라 생각 혔었는디 말이여유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308709","time":"2026-09-27T05:06:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"두 눈 질끈. 엘레나는 포기했습니다. 그야, 이런 걸 설명하는 건 델타인으로 충분했으니까요…….","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308710","time":"2026-09-27T05:06:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……아녜요, 각자마다 생각이 다른 거죠.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308711","time":"2026-09-27T05:08:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그렇죠...\"\n:: 끄덕.","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308712","time":"2026-09-27T05:08:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...뭐든, 생각한대로 그걸 대하면 충분하지 않을까...싶어요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308713","time":"2026-09-27T05:10:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"새삼, 남자들은 아이에 대해서 가볍게 생각하는구나….","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308714","time":"2026-09-27T05:11:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……아무튼, 결혼은 해도 아이는 신중하게 생각해 봐야 해요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308715","time":"2026-09-27T05:12:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그릏구먼유...\"\n\n피에르는 깨달음을 얻었다.","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308716","time":"2026-09-27T05:12:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"티티아 씨, 나중에 결혼했을 때… 남편이 많이 낳자! 이런 말하면 저한테 말하세요! 제가 혼낼게요!\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308717","time":"2026-09-27T05:13:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"네에..? 아뇨, 저 아이를 낳을 생각이...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308718","time":"2026-09-27T05:14:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……앗.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308719","time":"2026-09-27T05:14:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아, 그쵸! 아, 음….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308720","time":"2026-09-27T05:14:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……미안해요, 저도 아직 세상 보는 눈이 좁나 봐요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308721","time":"2026-09-27T05:15:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"지는 몇년 전 까지먼 혀도 우물 안 개구리였는디유 뭘.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308722","time":"2026-09-27T05:15:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"사실 지금도 그른거 같어유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308723","time":"2026-09-27T05:15:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"으응...? 괜찮아요. 저도 딱히 낳고 싶은 생각은 없고...스승님도 낳지 않는게 좋다고 하셔서 그럴뿐이라. 스승님이라면 뭐라도 알고계시려나요...으음...이럴때는 조금 아쉽네요. 바로 여쭤볼 수 없다는게.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308724","time":"2026-09-27T05:15:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"저도 아직 개구리인가 봐요….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308725","time":"2026-09-27T05:15:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"모르는 것들이 게속해서 나타나서 말이여유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308726","time":"2026-09-27T05:16:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"세상에는 다양한 이들이 많다는 걸, 애써 다시 되새깁니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308727","time":"2026-09-27T05:16:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"... ...뭐, 스승님은 아이도 못가질거라고 말해주셨던것 같은데...\"\n:: 곰곰히 생각하다 고개를 끄덕이며 중얼거립니다.","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308728","time":"2026-09-27T05:16:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"어차피 상관없으니까요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308729","time":"2026-09-27T05:20:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"그래도 아이 귀엽지 않나…? 바니 씨나, 티티아 씨 보면… 그래도 나는 낳고 싶어지던데….","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308730","time":"2026-09-27T05:20:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"약간 모성애… 그런…….","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308731","time":"2026-09-27T05:20:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"티티아를 빤히...","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308732","time":"2026-09-27T05:20:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...웅?\"\n:: 고민하다 엘레나를 보며 고개를 갸웃거립니다. \n웅? 무슨일이지...","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308733","time":"2026-09-27T05:20:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"왜 그러세요...?\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308734","time":"2026-09-27T05:22:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……제가 나중에 애기 낳으면, 티티아 씨 같은 애기면 좋겠다… 싶어서요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308735","time":"2026-09-27T05:23:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...아하하, 저를 닮으면 별로일텐데요? 귀찮을거에요 분명.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308736","time":"2026-09-27T05:23:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"네? 왜요?\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308737","time":"2026-09-27T05:23:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"전 티티아 씨 보면, 더… 애기 낳고 싶던데?\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308738","time":"2026-09-27T05:23:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아, 아니! 말이 이상한데…!\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308739","time":"2026-09-27T05:24:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...그게 어떤 감정인지...알기가 어렵지만...말썽도 많이 피우고, 요령도 피우고, 그나지 좋은 아이가 아니니까요. 오히려 나쁜아이니까...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308740","time":"2026-09-27T05:25:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"엘레나는 작게 웃어봅니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308741","time":"2026-09-27T05:25:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"델타인 같은 아기보다는… 훨 사랑스러울걸요?\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308742","time":"2026-09-27T05:25:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"델타인 미안해…….","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308743","time":"2026-09-27T05:26:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그리고 애는 다 그렇죠, 뭐. 원래 서툴러야 애죠!\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308744","time":"2026-09-27T05:26:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"음...\"\n\n피에르는 여자간의 대화를 처음 들어봤기에 굉장히 신선한 느낌을 받을 수 있었다.\n\n오히려 아기에 대해서 이야기를 하니 자신이 부끄러워지는 것 같기도 했고 말이다.","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308745","time":"2026-09-27T05:27:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...후후. 그런가요...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308746","time":"2026-09-27T05:27:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"... ...뭐든, 귀여울지도요. 새 생명은 언제나 사랑스러우니까요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308747","time":"2026-09-27T05:29:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"하아… 그렇죠, 뭐. 건강하게만 자라면 뭐가 싫겠어요!\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308748","time":"2026-09-27T05:29:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그릏지유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308749","time":"2026-09-27T05:29:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"피에르를 봅니다... 너무… 괜한 얘기를 했나…?","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308750","time":"2026-09-27T05:30:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"?\"\n\n피에르는 머리를 긁적였다...","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308751","time":"2026-09-27T05:30:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...뭐랄까, 갑자기 부모님이 궁금해지네요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308752","time":"2026-09-27T05:30:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그분들도, 저를 만나셨을때 기쁘셨으면 좋을텐데요. 후후.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308753","time":"2026-09-27T05:32:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"으음… 저는 동생들 태어날 때마다 엄청 기뻤어요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308754","time":"2026-09-27T05:32:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그러니까, 티티아 씨 부모님도 분명 그랬을 거예요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308755","time":"2026-09-27T05:32:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"지는 동생이 읎었어서 무슨 느낌인지 모르겄네유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308756","time":"2026-09-27T05:34:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"두 눈 질끈.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308757","time":"2026-09-27T05:34:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"또 할 말을 잃은 엘레나.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308758","time":"2026-09-27T05:34:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그런가요...뭐, 기뻐하지 않으셨어도 어쩔 수 없죠. 이제는 뵙지 못할테니까요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308759","time":"2026-09-27T05:35:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"부모님은 찾으러 갈수도 없어서요. 원래 이름도 잃어버린지 오래고. 전 이제 라이티티아니까.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308760","time":"2026-09-27T05:35:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"엘레나님의 말도 참 기뻐요, 감사해요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308761","time":"2026-09-27T05:35:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":":: 빵긋 웃습니다.","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308762","time":"2026-09-27T05:35:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"티티아가 기특한지, 괜히 머리를 쓰다듬어줍니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308763","time":"2026-09-27T05:36:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……하, 정말 나중에 티티아 씨 같은 딸 낳고 싶네요.\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308764","time":"2026-09-27T05:36:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아하하, 칭찬인건가요?\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308765","time":"2026-09-27T05:38:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"완전 칭찬이죠! 꼭 그러고 싶어요!\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308766","time":"2026-09-27T05:40:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"오... 지 애는 지보다 더 똑똑 헌 넘이 됐으믄 좋겄구먼유..\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308767","time":"2026-09-27T05:40:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"후후, 고마워요. 칭찬은 기분이 좋은거였네요.\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308768","time":"2026-09-27T05:41:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"뭐, 지식이야...사실, 배우는거에 따라 늘어날 수 있으니까요...열심히 교육하면...?\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308769","time":"2026-09-27T05:41:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그릏긴 허지유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308770","time":"2026-09-27T05:44:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"으음, 슬슬 자러 갈게요...저는. 자다가 중간에 나와본거라...\"","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308771","time":"2026-09-27T05:44:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"잘 주무셔유.\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308772","time":"2026-09-27T05:44:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"앗… 잘 자요, 티티아 씨!\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308773","time":"2026-09-27T05:44:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그르믄 엘레나 나으리는 지랑 같이 훈련이나 더 허실래유?\"","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308774","time":"2026-09-27T05:45:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"……저, 저도 최근에 장기 의뢰만 두 개… 다녀와서….\"","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308775","time":"2026-09-27T05:45:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"역시 농부라 체력이 좋으시네…….","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308776","time":"2026-09-27T05:46:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"라이티티아","profile":"라이티티아","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"네에...안녕히주무세요...\"\n:: 꾸벅 숙이고 총총 들어갑니다. 자자...","characters":["P-fae6af716ea2"]},{"id":"RP-0308777","time":"2026-09-27T05:46:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"피에르","profile":"피에르","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"알겄어유. 그르믄 지는 밭이나 관리허러 가야겄구먼유.\"\n\n피에르는 모닥불의 불을 끈 뒤, 밭으로 가기 시작했다.","characters":["P-1ba0b80ec424"]},{"id":"RP-0308778","time":"2026-09-27T05:47:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"엘레나도 검을 챙기고, 수건으로 머리를 마저 털며 들어갑니다.","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]},{"id":"RP-0308779","time":"2026-09-27T05:48:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"엘레나","profile":"Reggiano Elena","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"델타인이랑 언제 만나려나…….","characters":["P-89d5e8c6329e"]}]};
